 damage dice pool ?<br /> <br /> 5) How exactly does work armor soaking ? Let's consider I'm humain. I can't soak lethal damage without armor. But what happen when I actually wear an armor ? Do I only use the rating of the armor as dice pool ? Do I add my stamina ? We had a real debate with my ST because since him, it's always been only armor rating as dice pool in all other games in world of darkness even though that's not actually written that way in V20TDA. Since I'm new to this game, I'm curious as to what the actual rule is.<br /> <br /> 6) I've read that if difficulty reaches 10, then the action is impossible. So if during my turn I get attacked by someone wearing a sword and shield, and I declare a multiple action to defend and then attack myself, that means on my second action, the difficult is +2, and if I add the fact my opponent wears a sword and a shield it becomes 10, and I can't attack ?<br /> <br /> 7) Same question if I attack first but I choose to aim a weakness in the armor of my opponent (difficulty +2 but no armor dice in the soak dice pool). The difficulty becomes 10, right ? (6+2 for sword+shield + 2 for aiming the weakness) so it's basically not possible ?<br /> <br /> 8) If I choose to aim for armor weakness and armor doesn't add to soak damage, can a human soak lethal damage ? Does it still have only stamina ? Or no soak at all ?<br /> <br /> 9) How long exactly does Obtenebration 5 power last ? There's no detail about any duration.<br /> <br /> Thank you in advance for your knowledge, I will probably have many more questions !","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28250-beastelion","name":"Beastelion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28250_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}